  "title": "enterprises: recognize \"previously\" as synonym for \"formerly\"",
  "description": "Enterprise-names containing \"formerly\" are handled differently, removing the former name and only keeping the current one.\n\nSome enterprise-names have changed their names using the synonym \"previously\", which is currently not parsed in the same way. This commit modifies the script to recognize both.",
